* models.lib -- generic models for the cubbies benches (no vendor files: none redistributable offline)
* AO3400 worst case: Vth 1.45 V (datasheet max), Kp set so RDS(on) = 52 mohm at VGS 2.64 V
*   (ESP32-C3 VOH min 0.8 x VDD); capacitances from the AO3400A datasheet typical (Ciss ~630 pF). ASSUMED fit.
.model AO3400W VDMOS(Vto=1.45 Kp=16 Cgs=600p Cgdmax=150p Cgdmin=20p Rb=0.01 Is=1e-12 BV=30)
.model AO3400N VDMOS(Vto=1.05 Kp=20 Cgs=600p Cgdmax=150p Cgdmin=20p Rb=0.01 Is=1e-12 BV=30)
* 1N4148 (common public model)
.model D1N4148 D(Is=2.52n Rs=0.568 N=1.752 Cjo=4p M=0.4 tt=20n BV=100)
